## Assessment

The correction is narrowly scoped and resolves every prior finding. Critic completeness is now enforced both per record and across the checkpoint-authorized round batch; artifact references fail closed at the shared contract boundary; and lineage has an explicit authenticated anchor plus deterministic ambiguity handling. Task 5 is ready to proceed.
